        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "从哪里开始",
        "align": "left",
        "size": "medium"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "用 scripts/Install-EmeraldVeil.ps1 -Action Install/Verify/Remove 管安装，用 scripts/Set-NativeBubbles.ps1 -Action Enable/Verify/Disable/Restore 管策略；托盘可立即启动或预览。",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "40%"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "row": "start",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "60%",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **先看当前状态**　首次启用时留下原屏保设置；以后再启用只校验，必要时把旧格式的记录升级到新格式，但不替换已经记下的原值。",
        "row": "start",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
